OL,3,GNEWSACrews tackle large fire at
OL,4,Abusiness park
OL,5,
OL,6,FCrews are tackling a large fire
OL,7,Finvolving two industrial buildings at a
OL,8,Fbusiness park in West Sussex.
OL,10,FWest Sussex Fire and Rescue Service
OL,11,F(WSFRS) received the first of around 50
OL,12,Femergency calls at 16:24 BST on
OL,13,FThursday, alerting the service to a
OL,14,Fblaze at Lancing Business Park in
OL,15,FChartwell Road.
OL,17,FThere are currently six fire engines, a
OL,18,Fwater carrier and aerial ladder
OL,19,Fplatform at the scene, WSFRS said.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
